Question: Find the names of singers who have not sung in any concert in year 2014.
Target SQL: SELECT Name FROM singer WHERE Singer_ID NOT IN (SELECT T1.Singer_ID FROM singer_in_concert AS T1 JOIN concert AS T2 ON T1.concert_ID = T2.concert_ID WHERE T2.Year = '2014')

Database: flight_2
Schema:
CREATE TABLE airports (city text, airportcode text PRIMARY KEY, airportname text, country text, countryabbrev text);
